# Keep the build context small and free of secrets.
#
# The Dockerfile only COPYs requirements.txt and app/, so none of this would
# reach the image — but everything here is still uploaded to the daemon on
# every build, and .env holds the service role and Gemini keys.

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

README.md
